OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening with a few drizzly showers.
OL,7,FOvernight, rain moves into the west.
OL,8,FMostly light but turning showery into
OL,9,Fthe early hours. Showers easing by
OL,10,Fdawn with some clear spells
OL,11,Fdeveloping. Feeling fresher and less
OL,12,Fhumid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA mostly dry start with the
OL,15,Fodd shower developing around midday.
OL,16,FThese could turn heavy at times, with
OL,17,Fthe risk of thunder later before
OL,18,Fmoving eastwards. Temperatures around
OL,19,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
