OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fnortherly wind develops for the next
OL,7,Ffew days, allowing temperatures to
OL,8,Fdrop below average. Thunder showers
OL,9,Ffor Thursday and Friday, but brighter
OL,10,Fand drier for Saturday.
